# 5. P2-3：Policy Learning + CounterEvidence

## 目标

系统不能只积累“我判断对了”的证据，也要积累反证。

否则 Aurora 会越来越固执。

## PolicyEffectLedger

```json
{
  "policy_effect_id": "pe_001",
  "policy_key": "reduce_task_duration_after_overrun",
  "context_signature": {
    "goal_mode": "exam_rescue",
    "recent_overrun": true,
    "knowledge_bottleneck": "tcp_congestion_control"
  },
  "intervention": {
    "max_task_duration_min": 25,
    "avoid_new_chapter": true
  },
  "expected_outcome": [
    "task_started",
    "task_completed"
  ],
  "actual_outcome": {
    "task_started": true,
    "task_completed": false,
    "user_feedback": "不是没时间，是不会做"
  },
  "attribution": {
    "effect": "insufficient",
    "new_hypothesis": "knowledge_explanation_failure",
    "confidence": 0.63
  },
  "counter_evidence_for": [
    "task_too_large"
  ],
  "supporting_evidence_for": [
    "knowledge_bottleneck"
  ]
}
```

## 反证规则

如果系统判断：

```text
task_granularity_fit = too_large
```

但用户连续反馈：

```text
不是任务大，是看不懂
```

那么：

```text
task_granularity_fit confidence ↓
knowledge_bottleneck confidence ↑
strategy 从 shrink_task 改成 worked_example / step_by_step
```

## 验收标准

系统不能连续三次机械缩短任务。

如果用户连续反馈“不会做”，第三次必须触发：

```text
1. 策略改判；
2. Aurora self-correction；
3. new PolicyDecision；
4. Timeline card：我为什么不再只缩短任务。
```

