# 24. P4-5：Privacy-preserving Community Intelligence

## 目标

让社群经验成为 Sparkle 的平台智能，但不泄露个人。

## 机制

```text
cohort aggregate only
k-anonymity threshold
no raw personal trace sharing
no partner explanation without user confirmation
source quality aggregation
mistake cluster aggregation
skill effectiveness aggregation
```

## CommunityAggregateSignal

```json
{
  "aggregate_id": "",
  "cohort_scope": "same_course_exam_sprint",
  "min_group_size_met": true,
  "signal_type": "common_mistake | resource_quality | task_template_effectiveness",
  "node_id": "",
  "confidence": 0.76,
  "privacy_level": "aggregate_only",
  "recommended_effects": []
}
```

## 验收标准

```text
1. 聚合信号必须达到最小群体阈值；
2. 不能反推出个人；
3. 只作为 soft bias；
4. 用户能关闭社群智能；
5. CommunityDirective 写入 trace。
```

